{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53995","headline":"赵州和尚将游五台作偈留之（题拟） · 某大德","name":"赵州和尚将游五台作偈留之（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何（《五灯会元》作「无」）处青山不道场，何须策杖礼清凉。\n云中纵有金毛现，正眼观时非吉祥。\n（见《景德传灯录》卷十、《五灯会元》卷四。\n《石仓历代诗选》卷一一一误作从谂诗）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"某大德","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53995.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53995","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}